  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global.no - The Norwegian information portal for global issues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global.no is the Norwegian national information portal for Global issues. The portal is cooperation between governmental and nongovernmental parts. The services includes news, calendar, jobs and voluntary positions and an own service for Norwegian schools.</narrative>
  </description>
